
What is RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation)?
RAG = Search + Context + LLM Answer
Instead of asking the LLM to answer only from its training data:


We retrieve relevant documents from our own DevOps knowledge base


Inject that content into the prompt


The LLM answers grounded on your data


Why RAG is critical for DevOps agents


Cloud errors change frequently


Internal runbooks are private


Best practices differ per org


LLM hallucination is dangerous in infra


 RAG = Accuracy + Control + Trust

 High-Level Architecture You Implemented
User (Browser / API)
        ↓
ADK DevOps Agent
        ↓
RAG Tool (search)
        ↓
